'''Independence Day''' (インディペンデンスな日, ''Indipendensu na Hi'', '''Independence Day''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

==Combo==
